xQMMB_iLzt5VMbsg","isOwnerViewing":false,"shortDescription":"This is the second episode of Vibe Coding With Steve and Gene, with hosts Steve Yegge and Gene Kim.\n\nThe goal is to share with you what we’ve learned while writing the Vibe Coding book, which is coming out in October!\n\nWe’ve both been making the very last changes to the manuscript, which was due a couple of days ago.  We're so proud of how the book came out — it’s such a fun book to read, and shows how much we’ve learned, and how it can help every developer integrate AI into their daily work and the problems they face every day.\n\nThe goal is to record one of these every couple of days, and jump into one section of the book, and talk about some of the insights, some of the things that made it into the book, and some of the things that didn’t.\n\nThis episode is all about the various life-changing moments where vibe coding literally changed our lives. We tell those stories, and explain why we're both having so much fun.\n\nPre-order the book here: https://www.amazon.com/Vibe-Coding-Building-Production-Grade-Software/dp/1966280025\n\n00:00 Introduction to Vibe Coding Podcast\n00:08 The Journey of Writing the Vibe Coding Book\n00:36 Episode Format and Apologies\n01:09 Diving into FAAFO: Faster, Ambitious, Autonomous, Fun, and Optionality\n02:43 F: Faster\n03:52 A: Ambitious\n10:39 A: Autonomous or Alone\n18:44 F: Fun\n25:15 O: Optionality: Generating More Swings at Bat\n28:42 Conclusion and What's Next","isCrawlable":true,"thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/casRpzS64mE/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwFACKgBEF5IWvKriqkDMwgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AfABAfgB_gmAAtAFigIMCAAQARheIF4oXjAPuALzGA==\u0026rs=AOn4CLAPLDyZHs00W_sI9S6yjLz5paRl-Q","width":168,"height":94},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/casRpzS64mE/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwFACMQBEG5IWvKriqkDMwgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AfABAfgB_gmAAtAFigIMCAAQARheIF4oXjAPuALzGA==\u0026rs=AOn4CLAjrx0pFs86U7JKQKE_btuu2bvJhg","width":196,"height":110},{"url":"h